    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95848" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέλεκτος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελεκάν</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέληξ:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικεῖον ἱμάτιον, ἡμιδιπλοΐδιον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Suid.
		</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέλληξι: σπελέθοις</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέλιον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέλλιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Aeol.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψέλιον</span>, Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
			pp.203,504
		</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
			<u>An.Ox.</u>
			4.326
		</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπελλάμεναι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στειλάμεναι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aeolic</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπένδαμνον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλον</span>, Id. (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφ</span>.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπενδαυλέω</span></b> ,
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπενδεῖον</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπενδοποιέω</span></b> , f. ll. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπονδ-</span>.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
